  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Spaces for Conflict Prevention and Reduced Vulnerability in Abyei. A Joint Programme of the RCs in Sudan and South Sudan in Abyei.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention aims to contribute in addressing immediate needs and enhancing economic resilience in the Abyei region. To achieve this, IOM plans to a) increase vocational and entrepreneurial skills, equipping youth, including youth with disabilities, with integrated tools for employment and establishing small businesses; and b)provide start-up packages and mentoring to graduates in their efforts to ensure income.</narrative>
  </description>
